    "note": "`scripts/audit_manifest.py --pack toneking` reports CANNOT VERIFY against this plugin, and that is correct rather than a bug: it publishes 96 controls with real ranges, but keeps its Audio Unit state as opaque bytes instead of a document, so a preset key cannot be written into it and no key can be tied to a control by experiment. Matching the two lists by name alone reaches 35 of 259 and is a guess."
  },
  "draft": true,
